# Secrets — never commit. web/.env.local holds the Supabase secret key and DB
# password. Use web/.env.local.example as the template.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# Client analytics — real revenue, DAU and retention for Indigo's games.
# Internal private repo, and ALL of it is committed as of 2026-09-05.
#
# This used to ignore data/games/ on the grounds that it was "fully regenerable"
# from data/raw/. That was wrong in practice: a device switch left the new
# machine with no CSVs until every bundle was re-ingested, and the analysis
# surface people actually read (metrics/*.csv, summary.md, feedback.md,
# grab-report.md, place-versions.*) lived only on one laptop. The dataset is the
# product here — it travels with the repo, and it grows.
#
#   data/raw/    the untouched capture bundles. Cannot be re-created: Roblox
#                drops performance/error data after ~30d and errors after ~56d.
#   data/games/  the exported analysis surface, including series.json.
#   data/verify/ ground-truth dashboard exports + coverage measurements.

# Playwright's dedicated grab profile. Normally lives outside the repo
# (~/.rbx-grab-profile) but RBX_GRAB_PROFILE can point anywhere — a browser
# profile holds a live Roblox session cookie and must never be committable.
.rbx-grab-profile/
**/.rbx-grab-profile/

# Node / Next
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Scratch
*.log

# Pure caches — rebuild in seconds from data/games/*/metrics/*.csv, which now
# travel. Not "data"; regenerate with `python analysis/load.py`.
/analysis/analytics.duckdb
/analysis/__pycache__/
__pycache__/
